        },
        {
          "text": " Tena shetani akasimama juu ya Israeli, akamshawishi Daudi kuwahesabu Waisraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.27.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Nya 27:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi Daudi akamwambia Yoabu, na wakuu wa watu, Nendeni kawahesabu Israeli toka Beer-sheba mpaka Dani; mkanipashe habari, nipate kujua jumla yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Yoabu akasema, BWANA na awaongeze watu wake mara mia hesabu yao ilivyo; lakini, bwana wangu mfalme, si wote watumishi wa bwana wangu? Mbona basi bwana wangu analitaka neno hili? Mbona alete hatia kwa Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PRO.29.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mit 29:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ECC.8.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mhu 8:4",
