        {
          "text": " Naye Daudi akamwambia Mungu, Nimekosa sana, kwa kuwa nimelifanya jambo hili; lakini sasa uuondolee mbali, nakusihi, uovu wa mtumishi wako; kwani nimefanya upumbavu kabisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.21.8"
            ]
